{"nodes": [{"id": "doc:flow_tests", "label": "FLOW_TESTS.html (CBT Test Engine Flow Map + Test Pages Flow Map)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Concatenated HTML doc containing two architecture maps for the Trstprep V2.0 test engine: (1) CBT Test Engine Flow Map with execution journey, API endpoints, database schema, enrollment flow, timer state, security; (2) Test Pages Flow Map with 14 page components, API routes, interface flow, state management, routing and score calculation. Last updated March 8, 2026."}, {"id": "concept:cbt_test_engine", "label": "CBT Test Engine (Computer Based Test)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Real-time test execution engine featuring state tracking, timer logic, API submissions, attempt tracking, and anti-cheat mechanisms."}, {"id": "concept:trstprep_v2", "label": "Trstprep V2.0", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Project name. Architecture documentation target."}, {"id": "tech:postgresql_supabase", "label": "PostgreSQL (Supabase)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Primary database. 40+ tables hosted on Supabase PostgreSQL."}, {"id": "table:test_series", "label": "test_series (PostgreSQL table)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fields: id (PK), slug (unique), title, category, total_tests, is_pro, is_active. Two slightly differing schemas are documented across the two halves of FLOW_TESTS.html — the first uses snake_case (series_id FK), the second uses camelCase (examId FK, price, totalTests)."}, {"id": "table:tests", "label": "tests (PostgreSQL table)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fields: id (PK), series_id FK, title, duration_minutes, total_questions, total_marks, is_pro, type. Dual schema variants: first uses series_id/duration_minutes; second uses seriesId/duration/totalMarks/questions/negativeMarking/isLive."}, {"id": "table:questions", "label": "questions (PostgreSQL table)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fields: id (PK), test_id FK, question_html/questionText TEXT, options_array/options JSONB, correct_option/correctAnswer INTEGER, positive_marks/negative_marks, explanation, subject, difficulty. Holds question_html/options_array and correct_option fields; correct_option is stripped from client responses."}, {"id": "table:attempts", "label": "attempts (PostgreSQL table)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fields: id (PK), user_id FK, test_id FK, status, score DECIMAL, responses/answers JSONB, time_spent/timeSpent INTEGER, started_at/submitted_at TIMESTAMP, correct/wrong/isCompleted. Records each test attempt."}, {"id": "table:results", "label": "results (PostgreSQL table)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fields: id (PK), user_id FK, test_id FK, attempt_id FK, score DECIMAL, rank INTEGER, accuracy DECIMAL. Stores per-test results derived from attempts."}, {"id": "table:enrollments", "label": "enrollments (PostgreSQL table)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fields: id (PK), user_id FK, series_id FK, enrolled_at TIMESTAMP, is_active BOOLEAN. Tracks which users are enrolled in which test series. Legacy enrolledSeries array on user also checked for backward compatibility."}, {"id": "table:leaderboards", "label": "leaderboards (PostgreSQL table)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fields: id (PK), test_id FK, rankings JSONB, isPublished BOOLEAN, totalParticipants INTEGER. Stores per-test rankings."}, {"id": "table:live_tests", "label": "live_tests (PostgreSQL table)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fields: id (PK), test_id FK, startTime TIMESTAMP, endTime TIMESTAMP, status VARCHAR, participants INTEGER. Scheduled live test events."}, {"id": "table:users", "label": "users (PostgreSQL table)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Referenced as parent of attempts/results/enrollments. Has hasProPass BOOLEAN flag and legacy enrolledSeries VARCHAR[] array."}, {"id": "page:TestSeries", "label": "TestSeries.jsx", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Path src/pages/tests/TestSeries.jsx. Active. Public route /test-series for browsing all series."}, {"id": "page:TestDetails", "label": "TestDetails.jsx", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Path src/pages/tests/TestDetails.jsx. Active. Public route /test-series/:slug (or /test-series/:seriesId in pages doc)."}, {"id": "page:TestInstructions", "label": "TestInstructions.jsx", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Path src/pages/tests/TestInstructions.jsx. Protected. Route /test/:seriesId/:testId/instructions."}, {"id": "page:TestInterface", "label": "TestInterface.jsx", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Path src/pages/tests/TestInterface.jsx. Marked Critical/Protected. Hosts timer state, response matrix, auto-submit, and submission payload logic. Route /test/:seriesId/:testId or /test-interface/:attemptId."}, {"id": "page:TestResult", "label": "TestResult.jsx", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Path src/pages/tests/TestResult.jsx. Protected. Route /test-result/:seriesId/:testId or /test-result/:attemptId. Analytics & report view."}, {"id": "page:TestReview", "label": "TestReview.jsx", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Path src/pages/tests/TestReview.jsx. Protected. Route /test-review/:seriesId/:testId or /review."}, {"id": "page:LiveTests", "label": "LiveTests.jsx", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Path src/pages/tests/LiveTests.jsx. Active. Public route /live-tests for browsing scheduled live test events."}, {"id": "page:Leaderboard", "label": "Leaderboard.jsx", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Path src/pages/tests/Leaderboard.jsx. Active. Public route /leaderboard."}, {"id": "page:SeriesLeaderboard", "label": "SeriesLeaderboard.jsx", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Path src/pages/tests/SeriesLeaderboard.jsx. Active. Series-scoped leaderboard page."}, {"id": "page:PreviousYearPapers", "label": "PreviousYearPapers.jsx", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Path src/pages/tests/PreviousYearPapers.jsx. Active. Lists historical year papers."}, {"id": "page:PracticeQuestions", "label": "PracticeQuestions.jsx", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Path src/pages/tests/PracticeQuestions.jsx. Active. Contains hardcoded demo questions with exposed answers (lines 47-57) — flagged as security vulnerability in Hardcoded Data Migration Plan."}, {"id": "backend:tests_engine_js", "label": "tests-engine.js (backend route module)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Backend module referenced as source of test API endpoints: /api/series, /api/series/:slug, /api/series/:slug/tests, /api/tests/:id, /api/tests/:id/attempt, /api/attempts/:id/submit, /api/attempts/user/:userId."}, {"id": "backend:series_js", "label": "series.js (backend route module)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Backend module co-located with tests-engine.js for series-related endpoints."}, {"id": "backend:tests_js", "label": "tests.js (backend route module)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Backend module source for /api/tests, /api/tests/series/:seriesId, /api/tests/tag/:tag, /api/tests/:testId, /api/tests/:testId/questions, /api/tests/:testId/start, /api/tests/:testId/submit, /api/tests/:testId/result/:attemptId. Hosts score calculation algorithm and submit handler."}, {"id": "backend:postgres_helpers_js", "label": "postgres-helpers.js (db helper)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "PostgreSQL helpers with table whitelist. Exposes dbHelpers.find(collection, query) for enrollment lookups."}, {"id": "component:ProtectedRoute", "label": "ProtectedRoute (React component)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "React Router wrapper enforcing authentication for test instructions, interface, result, and review routes."}, {"id": "pattern:auto_submit", "label": "Auto-submit on timer expiry", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "When timeLeft/timeRemaining reaches 0 the TestInterface triggers autoSubmit. Trade-off: prevents indefinite time abuse while requiring robust local state preservation to avoid data loss on slow network."}, {"id": "pattern:server_side_grading", "label": "Server-side grading / answer stripping", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Backend strips correct_option/correctAnswer from /api/tests/:id questions payload and computes score on submit. Score = (correct × marksPerQuestion) − (wrong × negativeMarks); floored at 0. Rationale: prevents client-side answer leakage; client cannot tamper with grading."}, {"id": "pattern:csrf_protection", "label": "CSRF token validation", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "csrf_tokens table is whitelisted in postgres-helpers.js. Token validation on attempts and submissions. Defends against cross-site request forgery on test endpoints."}, {"id": "pattern:auto_enrollment", "label": "Auto-enrollment flow", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Logged-in non-enrolled user clicks 'Enroll Now' → POST /api/users/enroll/:seriesId auto-enrolls and returns updated user object with enrolledSeries array. Reduces friction in test series access."}, {"id": "pattern:pro_pass_gate", "label": "Pro Pass subscription gate", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "If test.isPro && !user.hasProPass, return 403 with 'PRO subscription required'. Pro users unlock all PRO tests; regular users see paywall ('Unlock with Pro Pass' / 'Enroll Now')."}, {"id": "pattern:submission_fail_safes", "label": "Submission fail-safes (network outage, retry, route blocking)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three named fail-safes: (1) Local state holds during network outage; (2) 10-second submit retry loop; (3) Route blocking on browser back. Combined: prevents attempt loss and re-entry mid-test."}, {"id": "vuln:hardcoded_answers", "label": "Hardcoded demo data with exposed answers", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "PracticeQuestions.jsx lines 47-57 contain fallback demo questions with exposed correctOption values. Documented as a known security vulnerability. Migration plan referenced: Hardcoded Data Migration Plan.html. Resolution: move to server-validated dataset; answers must never ship to the client in cleartext."}, {"id": "api:GET_series", "label": "GET /api/series", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Get all test series with test counts."}, {"id": "api:GET_series_slug", "label": "GET /api/series/:slug", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Get series by slug, check enrollment status."}, {"id": "api:GET_series_slug_tests", "label": "GET /api/series/:slug/tests", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Get all tests in a series."}, {"id": "api:GET_tests_id", "label": "GET /api/tests/:id", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Get test with questions (answers stripped)."}, {"id": "api:POST_tests_id_attempt", "label": "POST /api/tests/:id/attempt", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Start test attempt, create attempt record. Returns attemptId."}, {"id": "api:POST_attempts_id_submit", "label": "POST /api/attempts/:id/submit", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Submit answers, server-side grading."}, {"id": "api:POST_users_enroll", "label": "POST /api/users/enroll/:seriesId", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Auto-enrolls user and returns updated user object with enrolledSeries array."}, {"id": "api:PUT_tests_testId_submit", "label": "PUT /api/tests/:testId/submit", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Alternative submit route from tests.js. Submit test, calculate score."}, {"id": "api:GET_tests_testId_questions", "label": "GET /api/tests/:testId/questions", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Get test questions (protected)."}, {"id": "concept:submission_payload", "label": "Submission Payload (JSON contract)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Structure: { attemptId, answers:[{questionId, selected}], timeSpent }. Response payload: { attemptId, testId, seriesId, testTitle, score (≥0), totalMarks, totalQuestions, correct, wrong, unattempted, accuracy, timeSpent, rank, percentile, totalParticipants }."}, {"id": "concept:response_matrix", "label": "Response Matrix (per-attempt state)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "responses: { q_id: optionIndex }, statusMap: answered|review|skip, currentQuestion index. Stored in attempts.responses JSONB column."}, {"id": "concept:timer_state", "label": "Timer State (client)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Variables: timeLeft/timeRemaining (seconds, integer), setInterval decrement, isPaused flag, warnings (5min, 1min). Drives autoSubmit when 0."}, {"id": "concept:score_calculation", "label": "Score Calculation Algorithm", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "marksPerQuestion = totalMarks / totalQuestions (default 2). score = (correct × marksPerQuestion) − (wrong × negativeMarking). accuracy = correct / (correct+wrong) × 100. Final score clamped to ≥0 via Math.max(0, score)."}, {"id": "concept:user_states", "label": "User States (4 states)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Guest (redirect to login) → Logged-in not enrolled (Enroll CTA) → Enrolled (Start Test) → PRO user (all tests unlocked)."}, {"id": "doc:hardcoded_data_migration_plan", "label": "Hardcoded Data Migration Plan.html (linked)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Referenced companion document detailing remediation of the PracticeQuestions.jsx hardcoded-answer vulnerability."}], "edges": [{"source": "doc:flow_tests", "target": "concept:cbt_test_engine", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doc:flow_tests", "target": "concept:trstprep_v2", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\docs\\architecture\\flows\\FLOW_TESTS.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doc:flow_tests", "target": "tech:postgresql_supabase", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1